<%# Membership FAQ (conversion/pages/pricing.md). The founding answers show before doors open and during the founding window, the Store answer once the Store is on for every member (lib/hq-offer.js). %>
<% var fq = launch.prelaunch || launch.foundingOpen; var hqStore = typeof hqOffer !== 'undefined' && hqOffer && hqOffer.store ? hqOffer.store : null; var NUM = { 2: 'Two', 3: 'Three', 4: 'Four', 5: 'Five', 6: 'Six', 8: 'Eight', 10: 'Ten', 12: 'Twelve' }; %>
<div class="faq">
  <details open><summary>Is the free plan actually free?</summary><p>Yes. The assessment, weeks 1 and 2 of your roadmap with the playbooks and templates they use, the starter library and <%= PLANS.free.aiRunsPerMonth %> Eli's Playbook messages a month. No card.</p></details>
  <details><summary>Why not just use ChatGPT?</summary><p>ChatGPT doesn't know your roadmap. Eli's Playbook works from your assessment, your 30-day roadmap, and Eli's playbooks and calculators, so its answers fit where you are this week. And there's a real founder behind it.</p></details>
  <details><summary>Is this a course?</summary><p>No. There are no hours of video to sit through. It's a working system: short playbooks paired with an output, AI tools that apply them to your business, and templates you can use today.</p></details><% if (hqStore) { %>
  <details><summary>Do I pay for templates one at a time?</summary><p>No. Builder comes with every template in the Store, <%= hqStore.count %> so far, and none of them is sold on its own. The free plan has <%= hqStore.free %> of them.</p></details><% } %>
  <% if (fq) { %><details><summary>What does "locked" mean?</summary><p>Founding members pay <%= launch.foundingPrice ? '$' + launch.foundingPrice + ' a month' : 'the founding price' %> for as long as they stay subscribed, even if they switch plans. Cancelling ends it.</p></details><% } %>
  <details><summary>What if it's not for me?</summary><p>You have 14 days after your first paid Builder charge to change your mind. Email <a class="link" href="mailto:hello@127group.io">hello@127group.io</a> and we'll refund it in full to your card; the membership ends with it. Once per person. This doesn't apply to the Founder's Circle.</p></details>
  <% if (fq) { %><details><summary>Is there a Black Friday sale?</summary><p>No. The founding price is the deal.</p></details><% } %>
  <details><summary>Who is 127 for?</summary><p>People starting their first business, 18 and up, most in their twenties, who wonder what successful founders know that they don't. Early-stage founders who need better marketing, sales and systems fit too. The assessment routes you to the right track.</p></details>
  <details><summary>How is Eli's Playbook different from a regular AI chat?</summary><p>It's built on Eli's principles, his frameworks and the 127 library, and it knows your stage, goal and constraints from the assessment. It's direct and will push back on a weak plan. It won't give financial, legal or tax advice.</p></details>
  <details><summary>How does the Founder's Circle work?</summary><p><%= NUM[circleCapacity] || circleCapacity %> committed founders, by application. A weekly 45-minute call with Eli: everyone reports their number and last week's commitments on a Scorecard, two members get a 13-minute hot seat, and everyone leaves with commitments for next week. Plus a midweek Build Partner check-in and two in-person Founder Days a year. It's group guidance, not unlimited one-to-one consulting.</p></details>
  <details><summary>Can I cancel anytime?</summary><p>Yes. Cancel online anytime from Billing, for every plan. No call or email needed. You keep access until the end of the period you paid for.</p></details>
</div>
